<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN CUP MATCH SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN CUP MATCH SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary from Wednesday's German Cup</p>
<p>second round match:</p>
<p>Borussia Moenchengladbach 1 (Neun 9th minute) Bayern Munich 2</p>
<p>(Strunz 28th, Zickler 85th). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 34,500.</p>
</text>
